{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1000_p", "source_sha256": "00edea981fea16aa4f1cd2b4886d7569a73a909f7ab858c119323cdd240f7c91", "ja": "（詩花と出会えたアイドルサマーフェスが終わり、\nその興奮もまだ冷めやらぬ、ある日……）", "zh": "（在遇到诗花的偶像夏日祭结束后，\n于那股激昂尚未退去的某一天……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9133c127b0e199341efdaf4e484dc688cf847be8ece58347fb1e3d888a67be4e", "ja": "どうしたんだ昴、何かあったのか？\n急に呼び出したりなんかして……。", "zh": "怎么啦，昴？有什么事吗？\n突然叫我过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "298025f09351a2e170e77ecaf1bfb7fd643a9a1ad81a5b62120cd06568206269", "ja": "いいからいいから、{$P$}！\nちょっと、そこで見ててくれよ♪", "zh": "来就对了啦，{$P$}！\n你在那边看着喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "4c87f1c4eeff437e9e63119ad6eb5202339ae50b89d91964ffdd7d678bde0bfa", "ja": "それじゃ行くぜ？　せーの……。", "zh": "那我要上啰！一、二……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "cf94936bec18597ea6ecceb51532bc76c313f650df39adbbc552bea8a3c790f1", "ja": "グリュース・ゴット♪\nごきげんよう、{$P$}♪", "zh": "Grüß Gott♪\n你好呀，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7eb48c6cf6cc120f1e73a836b96a4be225ad7a64d67783156e20e4a2dc8502fd", "ja": "え！？　その挨拶は、もしかして……。", "zh": "咦！？这个打招呼的方式，莫非……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "32f4ee8baaf3119ee6285619257ab994e7d4df9899408a3096b8e1432e1b583d", "ja": "そう、詩花のマネ！　へへっ、どう？\nけっこうカワイくできたと思わないか？", "zh": "没错，就是在模仿诗花！嘿嘿，怎么样？\n我觉得自己学得挺可爱的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3c8c9cd43b1f113b18d65242a1520b8352736b4617ce104f0708fbf78628d8f2", "ja": "ああ。可愛いし、発音もいい感じだ。\n……けど、急にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯，很可爱，发音也很好听。\n……不过，你怎突然想这么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "6af2dda8164af8820d05d4adcedf6eef18df685435d476ab95866311a2e7ae15", "ja": "詩花って、女の子っぽくてカワイイな～と思ってさ。\nちょっと、マネしてみようかなって！", "zh": "我觉得诗花呀，很有女生的样子很可爱～\n所以就想模仿她看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "55557cc3d1db5facd7dabf9b123f4d6f19caa904796252e8bc21e5a9b0c1865c", "ja": "でもやっぱり、こういうのってオレっぽくないかな～。\n{$P$}は、どう思う？", "zh": "不过，这个样子还是不太适合我呢～\n{$P$}，你怎么看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9f694ff500fd3c11a28f3e7217100d304e91dfe70da0527142aa859a723df003", "ja": "そうだな。たしかに、普段の昴とは違うけど……。\nでも、昴らしい可愛さは出てたんじゃないかな。", "zh": "这个嘛，确实是跟平时的昴不一样……\n但我觉得有表现出属于昴的可爱哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "a8558cd9e1f49d9700fb5d9a10ed907fc6edaa7274252a9db5c2e25c5b16caa7", "ja": "えっ、ホントに！？　なあなあ、それって何！？\nどういうトコが、オレらしいの！？", "zh": "咦？真的吗！？欸欸，你是指什么！？\n什么地方才是属于我的可爱！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b45085775e5f3a39340ea708820d3d7250b8da7e6bbcffece1e76cf1d65256d9", "ja": "え？　えーと、そうだな。明るい笑顔とか、それでいて\nちょっと照れくさそうに、はにかむ表情だとか……。", "zh": "咦？我想想，这个嘛，开朗的笑容，\n然后有点害臊、难为情的表情等等……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1013_p", "source_sha256": "73e26dcb6e7d2e54bec683dad6d51707f6f0436b30bf29a86e01f09276988a3e", "ja": "詩花に詩花らしい可愛さがあるように、昴には\n昴らしい可愛さが……って、昴？　どうかしたのか？", "zh": "就像诗花有她自己的可爱一样，\n昴也是有自己的可……咦？昴？你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "5797c27578bd071bbe357c6ec8dcf3d5d3a9b03c9c16412e44b8d2bb43117998", "ja": "{$P$}って……\nなんでそんなに、オレのコト見てんの？", "zh": "我说{$P$}……\n你为什么看我看得这么仔细？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "61243c90ba3eaf0bb631459ee007c3604ca81bd5050ba2c47b5ff845df19a1dd", "ja": "そりゃオレ、ちょっと照れくさかったけど……\nなんか、そうハッキリ言われるとすっげーハズい……。", "zh": "我是觉得有点难为情没错……\n但被你这样直接说出来，感觉好害羞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c3fa0f06865ce03384955996d993c149728711bc1975bdc341ed78eaef8fb379", "ja": "す、すまない。\n悪い意味じゃないんだけど……。", "zh": "抱、抱歉，\n我其实是在称赞你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "c1ed2d9563e693c6871f9300797a2bed6b856c63e95289ec5b67f37f2a11f38e", "ja": "うん。……でも、これでわかった！\nオレはオレらしく！　それが一番だな♪", "zh": "嗯……不过，这样我就明白了！\n我就该保持自己的本色！这才是最好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "57bdbc8651445af0c0c320d453018fae125dcbcea0eea46971e47461893a1c47", "ja": "やっぱ詩花みたいになるには、コアラとか\nカンガルーとかいる国に住まないとダメなんだな～。", "zh": "要学会诗花那样，果然还是得住在\n有无尾熊跟袋鼠的国家才行呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1019_p", "source_sha256": "268204a8cc211163014fbb40337f40d50e206ab9687dc09491e08b06ebddd707", "ja": "いや、だからそれはオーストラリア……まぁいいか。\nそうだな、昴は昴らしく行こう！", "zh": "不是，就跟你说那是澳大利亚……算了。\n没错，昴展现自己就对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "d8f935e5a53f2e2214ff53442a75efad31dd0d3f1c18985917953ee4f219dfcf", "ja": "うん！　だから{$P$}、\n詩花もカワイイと思うけど……。", "zh": "嗯！所以{$P$}，\n诗花是很可爱没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0083_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "09143be65d162262bde4e2c24168b58245d5849029ee5d13b82e4c1a9788b4f7", "ja": "オレのコトも、ちゃんと見ててくれよな！　へへっ。\n約束だぜ♪", "zh": "但你也要好好关注我喔！\n嘿嘿，一言为定♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
